s Electronics International Inc. (Vancouver)<\/h3><h4 class=\"author-bio\"><span class=\"author-designation\">SEO<\/span><\/h4><\/div><div class=\"item-content-wrapper tss-right\"><div class=\"item-content\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">We have worked with several translation vendors in the past, but now we mostly use ABC Language Solutions translation services because they are fast and reliable. <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">They have been helping us promote international products from China and the US to Canadian markets by providing us with French translations. <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Their last translation allowed us to accomplish <strong>a $250,000 deal<\/strong> by successfully introducing a new car product into Canadian stores, including Best Buy. <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">If you want high-quality. fast translations, we recommend working with ABC Language Solutions.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">\u00a0<\/span>\r\n\r\n<b><i>\"Thank you for providing the alternatives, I have a French speaking sales rep too! I will go with ABC way!\"<\/i><\/b><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"rt-col-md-12 rt-col-sm-12 rt-col-xs-12 even-grid-item tss-grid-item slide-item swiper-slide even-grid-item default-margin tss-img-circle\"><div class=\"single-item-wrapper\"><div class=\"tss-meta-info tss-left\"><div class=\"profile-img-wrapper\"><img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Wayne, Diamond (Vancouver)\" class=\"rt-responsive-img\" src=\"https:\/\/www.abc-lang.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/08\/0-02-05-4d78c04fbeb803036f6c6eb05744f5e843a2c7e4e5fe53ed8f852d9a811192b0_6e085cbf3742acd4-1-150x150.png\" \/><\/div><h3 class=\"author-name\">Wayne, Diamond (Vancouver)<\/h3><h4 class=\"author-bio\"><span class=\"author-designation\">SEO<\/span><\/h4><\/div><div class=\"item-content-wrapper tss-right\"><div class=\"item-content\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Fast and accurate communication with our partners and suppliers is a core i